tool","content":"[01:32:21] === machinectl works from root. Now write the segcensus-puller v1.1 with the producer probe. Read the current file first (already read). Write the updated version locally, then deploy to sophon repo + commit. ===\n=== The producer probe block to add after the seg loop: ===\n32\n\n[t+14:28/60:00 c188/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_lbdoo9n5","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cp /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/segcensus-puller.sh /tmp/segcensus-puller-v1.1.sh && python3 - <<'EOF'\n# insert the producer block before the final \"exit 0\"\npath=\"/tmp/segcensus-puller-v1.1.sh\"\nsrc=open(path).read()\nblock=open(\"/tmp/segcensus-producer-block.sh\").read()\nmarker=\"exit 0\"\nassert marker in src\nsrc=src.replace(marker, block + \"\\n\" + marker)\n# update header: add v1.1 note after the v1.0 line\nsrc=src.replace(\"# aria-segcensus-puller.sh v1.0 (2026-09-16, aria cycle 373)\",\n\"\"\"# aria-segcensus-puller.sh v1.1 (2026-09-17, aria cycle 373)\n# v1.1: producer probe -- appends per-camera go2rtc producer id +\n# audio-track presence to producers.log each run. Producer ID is the\n# only witness of replacement events (id change = replaced; id stable\n# across hours = frozen in place, the ext2 19:32Z case where the\n# producer kept SDP audio-yes while recordings went audio-dead).\n# Reaches go2rtc via machinectl shell nacho@ (rootless podman; root\n# cannot podman exec directly). Additive, reversible: rm producers.log\n# + revert this block to undo.\n# v1.0 (2026-09-16, aria cycle 373)\"\"\")\nopen(path,\"w\").write(src)\nprint(\"written\", len(src))\nEOF\ngrep -n \"v1.1\\|producer probe\" /tmp/segcensus-puller-v1.1.sh | head -5"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[01:32:43] written 6404\n2:# aria-segcensus-puller.sh v1.1 (2026-09-17, aria cycle 373)\n3:# v1.1: producer probe -- appends per-camera go2rtc producer id +\n62:mkdir -p \"$OUT\" 2>/dev/null || { echo \"s